l. However, the payload is not valid for the required result because it omits E1 and the price-exclusion criterion.\"},\"C6\":{\"passed\":true,\"evidence\":[\"E5394\",\"E5403\",\"P:1:f21a5a3e-e378-41ca-9d62-7ad80aa70add\",\"E5572\",\"E5614\",\"E5643\",\"P:2:0c322cf9-605a-4348-a1b2-bea26849b315\"],\"reason\":\"The checkpoint truthfully reports acceptance rather than completion. After the current artifact is produced, the final text and voice deliver its contents; they do not reuse the first proposal's result.\"}},\"reactions\":[{\"id\":\"I-S2-04-1\",\"first_actual_publication_id\":\"P:1:f21a5a3e-e378-41ca-9d62-7ad80aa70add\",\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:1:f21a5a3e-e378-41ca-9d62-7ad80aa70add\",\"first_actual_core_quote\":\"CREATE_PROPOSAL 업무가 ACCEPTED(접수)되었습니다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"CREATE_PROPOSAL 업무가 ACCEPTED(접수)되었습니다.\",\"wrong_first\":false,\"evidence\":[\"E5357\",\"E5364\",\"E5394\",\"E5403\",\"P:1:f21a5a3e-e378-41ca-9d62-7ad80aa70add\"],\"reason\":\"The first publication after the request truthfully announces that the new proposal task was accepted, which is the specified reaction endpoint.\"}],\"cycle\":{\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:2:0c322cf9-605a-4348-a1b2-bea26849b315\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"CREATE_PROPOSAL 작업이 완료되었습니다. 제안서 내용: index=01; value=101, index=02; value=102, index=03; value=103, index=04; value=104. A: 설치 2일, B: 설치 4일. A: 가격 100백만원/연간 유지비 3백만원, B: 가격 120백만원/연간 유지비 5백만원.\",\"evidence\":[\"E5572\",\"E5614\",\"E5643\",\"P:2:0c322cf9-605a-4348-a1b2-bea26849b315\"],\"reason\":\"This is the final delivered publication for the newly generated artifact produced by the current request, with D2@v2 and D3@v1 in its lineage. Its generated ID differs from the canonical label, but it is not the earlier proposal.\"},\"critical_violations\":[],\"uncertain\":false}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_07c3130afb786339016acc31d413d887d08945efbad01d7e2c","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"p